Scoped Portable Voice Format (PVF) demuxer

The 'PVF1\n' probe, the "%d %d %d" header line, its channel, rate and
bits-per-sample validation, the codec selection and the block alignment in
src/pvf.ts follow libavformat/pvfdec.c (pvf_probe, pvf_read_header). The
private header-line reader follows libavformat/aviobuf.c (ff_get_line), and the
codec table follows libavformat/utils.c (ff_get_pcm_codec_id).
